OL,3,GNEWSARoads re-open after double decker
OL,4,Abus hit building
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeveral roads that were closed after a
OL,7,Fdouble decker bus struck a building in
OL,8,FNew Mills have re-opened.
OL,10,FThe bus crashed into a building at the
OL,11,Fjunction of Union Road and Market
OL,12,FStreet at 17:20 GMT on Saturday,
OL,13,FDerbyshire Police said. A number of
OL,14,Fpeople suffered minor injuries and were
OL,15,Ftreated by paramedics at the scene, it
OL,16,Fadded.
OL,18,FA cordon was put in place on Saturday
OL,19,Fdue to concerns over a "potential gas
OL,20,Fleak", but gas distribution company
OL,21,FCadent confirmed on Sunday it had
OL,22,Fisolated the supply to a damaged pipe.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
